# .cursor/rules/design-system.mdc

Design System Rules:
- Use consistent spacing system.
- Prefer rounded UI components.
- Avoid sharp corners unless intentionally used for emphasis.
- Buttons should feel touch-friendly.
- Use modern mobile-first layouts.
- Minimize cognitive load.
- Avoid overcrowded screens.
- Financial data should be visually scannable.
- Charts should remain simple and understandable.
- Empty states should guide users clearly.